{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-8-17","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：立方与整数","englishTitle":"If a cube number do not measure a cube number, neither will the side measure the side; and, if the side do not measure the side, neither will the cube measure the cube.","book":8,"number":17,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.17","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.17/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":17,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-8-17@raw-0f9b11b7980d3d03","contentId":"euclid-8-17","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0f9b11b7980d3d033508986667b1f9a9f235923bd7972d85b5833127ab927378","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-8-17.statement","euclid-8-17.construction.1","euclid-8-17.proof.1","euclid-8-17.proof.2","euclid-8-17.proof.3","euclid-8-17.proof.4","euclid-8-17.conclusion","euclid-8-17.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-8-17.statement","contentId":"euclid-8-17","revisionId":"euclid-8-17@raw-0f9b11b7980d3d03","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0417afd2a5920fa244b0ac60d168b966e1c7c35d8d9c4c1bb585ba531d5da0f9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a cube number do not measure a cube number, neither will the side measure the side; and, if the side do not measure the side, neither will the cube measure the cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果立方数分之一的不是整除分的立方数分, 一方的整除分的也不算;如果整除分的不是整除分的一方, 立方体的整除分的也不算。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-17.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-8-17","revisionId":"euclid-8-17@raw-0f9b11b7980d3d03","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e6d9c446e18517e754323c1d1a857c4a3c2b07a8b5757c59032dbdd285535c36","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the cube number A not measure the cube number B, and let C be the side of A, and D of B; I say that C will not measure D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让我们立方数 A而不是整除,立方数 B,C是A的一方,B中的D是A的一方;我说C不会整除 D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-17.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-8-17","revisionId":"euclid-8-17@raw-0f9b11b7980d3d03","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6a67851f725866af8dc1bf3af5b4bee89b6e939ae5eb3025ac69c64ae8210afd","citations":["euclid-8-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For if C measures D, A will also measure B. [[VIII. 15](/principles/euclid-8-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C 整除 D,A 也意味着整除 B [[VIII. 15](/principles/euclid-8-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-17.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-8-17","revisionId":"euclid-8-17@raw-0f9b11b7980d3d03","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5afc0b8cc1b1b0b0084147bf64fabe7283623366a9391964c8c09d776329be19","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But A does not measure B; therefore neither does C measure D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A没有整除 B;因此,C 整除 D也没有。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-17.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-8-17","revisionId":"euclid-8-17@raw-0f9b11b7980d3d03","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"812c223087a48df76a9e4d61d828b00755ae1050f35952c3b2a43fbe97b93f4c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, let C not measure D; I say that neither will A measure B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,让C而不是整除 D;我说A 整除 B也不会。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-17.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-8-17","revisionId":"euclid-8-17@raw-0f9b11b7980d3d03","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5b71eb673040a58fcdb1d0bf14d670e15343cd9ab256810f2dffae09405a54b2","citations":["euclid-8-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if A measures B, C will also measure D. [[VIII. 15](/principles/euclid-8-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果A 整除 B,C 也整除 D的话 [[VIII. 15](/principles/euclid-8-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-17.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-8-17","revisionId":"euclid-8-17@raw-0f9b11b7980d3d03","order":6,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e233b763c29b383508d8dad8fa9f225bf3657b5839e1cbb708a02145c753625f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But C does not measure D; therefore neither will A measure B. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但C没有整除 D,因此,A 整除 B. 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-17.source","contentId":"euclid-8-17","revisionId":"euclid-8-17@raw-0f9b11b7980d3d03","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"54afae59ece5143b4e928720578ba2996b114da1002cec827659a061c0977f0b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / He